The PNG files in this directory are Twemoji country-flag icons.

Copyright 2020 Twitter, Inc and other contributors.
Graphics licensed under CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
Source: https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji

They are redistributed here so that Exhibit X2 can be regenerated without a
network fetch. The attribution required by CC BY is carried on the figure itself,
appended to its source line by paper/annotate_flags.py.
